WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.016
Riley: The park is crowded.

2
00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:21.611
Theo: Everyone is here to watch our soccer game.

3
00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:25.529
Ben: Speedy likes the warm sun.

4
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.886
Sarah: I like your red uniforms.

5
00:00:28.887 --> 00:00:31.716
Theo: They are so bright.

6
00:00:31.717 --> 00:00:35.217
Everyone will be able to see us on the field.

7
00:00:35.218 --> 00:00:39.793
Skyler: I hope everyone sees me score a goal.

8
00:00:39.794 --> 00:00:43.508
Skyler: I practiced for two hours last night!

9
00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:46.935
Riley: If I get the ball, I'll pass it to you.

10
00:00:46.936 --> 00:00:51.320
Skyler: Then I'll run as fast as I can and score!

11
00:00:51.321 --> 00:00:53.525
Chatter: Go, team!

12
00:00:53.526 --> 00:00:58.638
Riley: Let's teach Chatter to say, "Go, Red Team."

13
00:00:58.639 --> 00:01:01.595
Chatter: Do your homework!

14
00:01:01.596 --> 00:01:07.195
Theo: Chatter, listen. Say, "Go, Red Team!"

15
00:01:07.196 --> 00:01:10.116
Chatter: Red!

16
00:01:10.117 --> 00:01:11.980
Skyler: That's better!

17
00:01:11.981 --> 00:01:15.612
Riley: Chatter will make a great mascot.

18
00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:18.290
Theo: He'll bring good luck to our team.

19
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:22.694
Skyler: And help us score goals!

20
00:01:22.695 --> 00:01:26.248
Riley: There's a special prize for the best sport.

21
00:01:26.249 --> 00:01:30.034
Theo: That's someone who cheers for both sides.

22
00:01:30.035 --> 00:01:34.191
Riley: And doesn't get upset if she loses.

23
00:01:34.192 --> 00:01:39.226
Skyler: I just want to win the game.

24
00:01:39.227 --> 00:01:42.641
Theo: Here comes Coach Ryan.

25
00:01:42.642 --> 00:01:46.247
We're about to start!

26
00:01:46.248 --> 00:01:48.460
Mrs. Summers: Good luck, everyone!

27
00:01:48.461 --> 00:01:54.874
Kelli: Go, Theo, Riley, and Skyler!

28
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:57.530
Skyler: Don't forget to cheer for us, Chatter.

29
00:01:57.531 --> 00:01:59.589
We're counting on you!

30
00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:05.139
Chatter: One, two, three, four, five, six!

31
00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:09.448
Riley: Here comes the other team.

32
00:02:09.449 --> 00:02:13.210
Skyler: Look, they're wearing blue uniforms!

33
00:02:13.211 --> 00:02:16.297
Theo: Blue?

34
00:02:16.298 --> 00:02:19.110
Chatter: Blue, blue, blue!

35
00:02:19.111 --> 00:02:26.273
Theo: Uh-oh. Something tells me this isn't going to be good!
